"description":"TAROO: CREATIVE GAMES FOR KIDS AGES 6–10\n\nTaroo is a creative learning app where kids don't just play games. They draw, write stories, make music, observe the world, solve creative challenges, and express their own ideas.\n\nThrough short, playful activities, kids practice creativity and communication while making something of their own.\n\nDRAW, WRITE, TELL STORIES & MAKE MUSIC\n\nTaroo brings different creative skills together in one kid-friendly app.\n\nKids can:\n\n• Draw pictures and complete creative art challenges\n• Write stories, captions, and imaginative responses\n• Practice storytelling and expressing ideas\n• Make rhythms and experiment with music\n• Explore observation, imagination, and creative problem-solving\n\nEvery activity is designed to feel like a game while encouraging kids to think, make, and experiment.\n\nLEARNING THAT FEELS LIKE PLAY\n\nTaroo helps kids practice skills that are difficult to build through worksheets and multiple-choice questions.\n\nActivities encourage kids to:\n\n• Develop stronger writing and vocabulary\n• Become more confident expressing ideas\n• Practice drawing and visual thinking\n• Strengthen observation and attention to detail\n• Explore imagination and creative problem-solving\n• Keep improving an idea instead of stopping at the first answer\n\nThere are no single “right answers.” Kids are encouraged to explore different possibilities and create in their own way.\n\nSHORT CREATIVE GAMES KIDS CAN PLAY INDEPENDENTLY\n\nTaroo includes a growing collection of creative games and challenges.\n\nIn Doodle Master, kids draw from prompts and references.\n\nIn Pass the Pen, kids build stories together through writing.\n\nIn Rhythm Pad, kids experiment with beats and music.\n\nIn Snap Trail, kids use observation and curiosity to explore the world around them.\n\nDifferent games exercise different skills, so kids can move naturally between drawing, writing, storytelling, music, observation, and imagination.\n\n### GENTLE AI GUIDANCE\n\nCreating is easier when someone helps you get started.\n\nTaroo uses AI to provide age-appropriate prompts, encouragement, and feedback that help kids develop their ideas.\n\nThe goal isn't to grade creativity or tell children what to make. Instead, Taroo encourages them to add detail, try another approach, and keep creating.\n\nNo tests. No pressure. No “wrong” creative answers.\n\n### SEE WHAT YOUR CHILD CREATES\n\nProgress in Taroo isn't only about points or levels.\n\nKids create real things: drawings, stories, writing, music, and other creative projects they can look back on and feel proud of.\n\nParents can also stay connected to what their child is exploring and creating.\n\nMADE FOR KIDS AND FAMILIES\n\n• Kid-friendly, calm design\n• No ads\n• No social media or open chat\n• Creative activities designed for independent play\n• Parent controls and visibility into activity\n• A cozy alternative to passive entertainment\n\nTURN PLAYTIME INTO CREATIVE TIME\n\nA tablet can be more than something kids watch or tap through.\n\nWith Taroo, kids can use it to draw, imagine, write, make music, tell stories, and create.\n\nDownload Taroo and start creating today.\n\nSupport: [founders@taroo.ai](mailto:founders@taroo.ai)\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.taroo.ai/privacy-policy\nTerms of Service: https://www.taroo.ai/terms-of-service", "minimumOsVersion":"15.5", "trackCensoredName":"Taroo - Creativity games", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/taroo-creativity-games/id6756703607?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":5, "userRatingCount":13}, 
