"description":"Turn any idea into a Playable instantly with AI.\nLoopit is the premier platform to make playables. From viral interactive memes to satisfying tactile mini-games, we give you the tools to create experiences that people don’t just watch — they touch, play, and remix. Powered by AI, built for creators.\n\nTHE FUTURE OF PLAY IS INTERACTIVE\nA \"playable\" is more than just a game; it’s a moment of interaction. With Loopit, you can:\n- AI-Powered Creation: Just describe your vision. Our AI engine builds the logic and art of your playable in seconds.\n- No-Code Mastery: You don't need to be a developer to make playables. Our intuitive editor handles the complexity so you can focus on the fun.\n- Remix Culture: See a cool idea in your feed? Tap Remix to twist the mechanics, swap the visuals, and make it yours instantly.\n\nBEYOND JUST MINI GAMES\nWhat can you build when you make playables?\n- Interactive Memes: Create memes your friends can actually play with.\n- ASMR & Tactile Toys: Relaxing, responsive tools that react to every swipe and tap.\n- Playable Art: Visuals that come to life through user interaction.\n- Mini Puzzles & Simulations: Quick, clever ideas that loop forever.\n\nJOIN THE GLOBAL UGC REVOLUTION\nLoopit is a never-ending feed of interactive surprises. Whether you're here to make playables or scroll through the world's most creative community-made content, there's always something new to pop.\nFree to create. Free to play. Endless to remix.\nLoopit — make everything playable!", "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "trackCensoredName":"Loopit - AI Playable Maker", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/loopit-ai-playable-maker/id6755859360?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4.8189299999999999357669366872869431972503662109375, "userRatingCount":46767}, 
